              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "To log into your **PreLicenseTraining.com (PLT)** account, you can use the direct links and instructions below:\n\n### 1. Student Login\nIf you are a student taking pre-licensing or continuing education (CE) courses:\n* **Direct Login Page:** Visit the [PreLicenseTraining.com Account Login](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/login) page.\n* **Alternative Route:** Go to the [PreLicenseTraining.com Homepage](https://www.prelicensetraining.com) and click **Login** in the top navigation menu.\n* Enter your **Email Address** and **Password** to access your courses, StudyHall, or VideoCram materials.\n\n### 2. Mentor / Recruiter Login\nIf you are a manager, recruiter, or mentor tracking student progress:\n* **Direct Mentor Login Page:** Go to the [PLT Mentor Portal Login](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/mentor/login).\n* This portal allows you to manage student rosters, track course completion, and view study timelines.\n\n### Troubleshooting & Support\n* **Forgot Password:** If you cannot remember your password, click the **Forgot Password?** link on the login page, or go directly to the [PLT Password Reset Page](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/forgot-password) to enter your email and receive reset instructions.\n* **Contact Support:** If you encounter technical issues or cannot log in, you can contact PreLicenseTraining support by phone at **1 (800) 780-2113**.",
